<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>Vinofilo · 葡萄品种</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/fenlei/pinzhong/</link><description>葡萄与它们的个性</description><language>zh</language><atom:link href="https://vinofilo.com/zh/fenlei/pinzhong/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ruchè：被一位本堂神父从遗忘中救回的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/ruche-castagnole-monferrato-shenfu-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.10/ruche-castagnole-monferrato-shenfu-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Ruchè di Castagnole Monferrato，2010年起为DOCG：Giacomo Cauda神父的故事、产区的七个市镇，以及玫瑰、紫罗兰与香料的轮廓。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ruche-di-castagnole-monferrato.jpg?v=c5e9c008" length="337035" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/ruche-di-castagnole-monferrato.jpg?v=c5e9c008" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>意大利的Pinot Nero：向勃艮第发起的挑战</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/yidali-pinot-nero-tiaozhan-bogendi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.09/yidali-pinot-nero-tiaozhan-bogendi/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从Alto Adige到Oltrepò，从特伦蒂诺到弗留利：为什么Pinot Nero是最难驯服的品种，以及意大利在哪里做到了。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pinot-nero-in-italia.jpg?v=b9c1fd31" length="375269" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pinot-nero-in-italia.jpg?v=b9c1fd31" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Teroldego Rotaliano：诞生在平原上的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/teroldego-rotaliano-pingyuan-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.07/teroldego-rotaliano-pingyuan-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>一款长在谷底而非山坡上的特伦蒂诺红酒：Teroldego Rotaliano的历史、DOC产区规定、显赫的亲戚（包括Syrah）与风格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/teroldego-rotaliano.jpg?v=6240e98b" length="425526" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/teroldego-rotaliano.jpg?v=6240e98b" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Sagrantino di Montefalco：会咬人、也愿意等的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/sagrantino-montefalco-yaoren-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.06/sagrantino-montefalco-yaoren-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从节庆时的风干甜酒，到法定陈酿37个月的干型红酒，Sagrantino di Montefalco的历史、DOCG产区规定，以及这款意大利单宁最重的红酒的性格。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sagrantino-di-montefalco.jpg?v=e4c4b039" length="378841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sagrantino-di-montefalco.jpg?v=e4c4b039" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Pecorino与Passerina：从无到有重归的白葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pecorino-passerina-offida-docg-baiputao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.05/pecorino-passerina-offida-docg-baiputao/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>两种几近绝迹的葡萄，如今是Offida DOCG的主角。马尔凯与阿布鲁佐的重新发现，以及关于它们名字的传说，需谨慎对待。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pecorino-e-passerina.jpg?v=d54dc0dd" length="218964" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/pecorino-e-passerina.jpg?v=d54dc0dd" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Fiano与Greco：向时间挑战的伊尔皮尼亚白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/fiano-greco-yierpinia-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.11.01/fiano-greco-yierpinia-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Fiano di Avellino与Greco di Tufo，伊尔皮尼亚那些越陈越好的白酒。土壤、海拔、硫磺，以及一场几乎出人意料的复兴。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiano-e-greco-bianchi-irpinia.jpg?v=5bd0b5d7" length="257594" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/fiano-e-greco-bianchi-irpinia.jpg?v=5bd0b5d7" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Grillo、Catarratto、Inzolia、Carricante：西西里的白葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/xixili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.31/xixili-baipu-tao-grillo-catarratto/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>四种白葡萄，带你认识Marsala与埃特纳之外的西西里：盐田、海风，以及在这样炎热的岛上很少有人料到的酸度。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" length="207534" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/grillo-catarratto-bianchi-siciliani.jpg?v=dffb1f92" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Nero d&#x27;Avola：从调配用酒到西西里的象征</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/nero-davola-xixili-de-xiangzheng/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.30/nero-davola-xixili-de-xiangzheng/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0100</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>几十年来，南方把它运往北方，给别的酒添色。如今Nero d&#x27;Avola有了自己的产区、自己的分区，终于也有了自己的面孔。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nero-d-avola-oltre-il-cliche.jpg?v=c4a1f322" length="279039" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nero-d-avola-oltre-il-cliche.jpg?v=c4a1f322" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Marsala：被我们关进厨房的意大利伟大葡萄酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/marsala-bei-yiwang-de-weida-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.23/marsala-bei-yiwang-de-weida-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从John Woodhouse到Florio，从蛋黄Marsala到重生：这款意大利最被低估的加强酒的历史、类别与翻身之路。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/marsala-il-grande-dimenticato.jpg?v=1f09bd1d" length="253384" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/marsala-il-grande-dimenticato.jpg?v=1f09bd1d" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Montepulciano：是阿布鲁佐的葡萄品种，还是托斯卡纳的城市？</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.21/montepulciano-putaopinzhong-haishi-chengshi/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.21/montepulciano-putaopinzhong-haishi-chengshi/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Montepulciano d&#x27;Abruzzo与Vino Nobile di Montepulciano只有名字相同：品种、大区、产区规章，以及如何在酒标上读懂它们。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/montepulciano-vitigno-o-citta.jpg?v=d0254329" length="367209" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/montepulciano-vitigno-o-citta.jpg?v=d0254329" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Dolcetto并不甜：它是朗格最老实的红酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.13/dolcetto-bu-tian-langa-hongjiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.13/dolcetto-bu-tian-langa-hongjiu/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>干爽、深色、不爱摆姿态，Dolcetto的名字会骗人。多利亚尼、迪亚诺达尔巴、奥瓦达，以及为什么如今种的人越来越少。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/dolcetto-non-e-dolce.jpg?v=ad5361f9" length="238796" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/dolcetto-non-e-dolce.jpg?v=ad5361f9" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>巴贝拉：决心长大的“平民葡萄”</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.12/barbera-pimeng-putao-jueding-zhangda/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.12/barbera-pimeng-putao-jueding-zhangda/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>酸度鲜活，单宁温和：巴贝拉如何从日常红酒，一路成为阿斯蒂、尼扎和阿尔巴的主角，并远行到加利福尼亚与阿根廷。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/barbera-vitigno-del-popolo.jpg?v=70701962" length="302937" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/barbera-vitigno-del-popolo.jpg?v=70701962" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>内比奥罗：意大利最难伺候、也最伟大的葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/nebiaoluo-yidali-zui-nan-de-putao/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.10.06/nebiaoluo-yidali-zui-nan-de-putao/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>颜色浅淡，单宁凶猛，成熟很晚：从巴罗洛到瓦尔泰利纳，为什么内比奥罗既考验种它的人，也考验喝它的人。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nebbiolo-vitigno-piu-difficile.jpg?v=d8ca6808" length="273522" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/nebbiolo-vitigno-piu-difficile.jpg?v=d8ca6808" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>桑娇维塞：一个品种，百副面孔（却没有身份证）</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/sangiovese-yige-pinzhong-baifu-miankong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.30/sangiovese-yige-pinzhong-baifu-miankong/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>经典基安蒂、布鲁奈罗、诺比利、莫雷利诺、罗马涅：同一个桑娇维塞为何每座山丘都换一张脸，又为何盲品时能骗过所有人。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sangiovese-cento-volti.jpg?v=ad43ed01" length="321864" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sangiovese-cento-volti.jpg?v=ad43ed01" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Aglianico：被称作“南方巴罗洛”，却不需要皮埃蒙特</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.29/aglianico-nanfang-baroluo-putao-pinzhong/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.29/aglianico-nanfang-baroluo-putao-pinzhong/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Taurasi、Vulture与Taburno：为什么Aglianico被叫作“南方巴罗洛”，以及这个绰号为何终究显得太小，装不下这个品种。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aglianico-barolo-del-sud.jpg?v=f0430e62" length="250803" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/aglianico-barolo-del-sud.jpg?v=f0430e62" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Verdicchio：比许多红酒更耐陈的白酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/verdicchio-bijiao-hongjiu-geng-naichen-de-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/verdicchio-bijiao-hongjiu-geng-naichen-de-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Castelli di Jesi与Matelica、双耳瓶造型、DOCG Riserva：为什么Verdicchio是真正懂得等待的意大利白酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/verdicchio-bianco-che-invecchia.jpg?v=fe385772" length="300005" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/verdicchio-bianco-che-invecchia.jpg?v=fe385772" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Timorasso：皮埃蒙特忘了自己拥有的那款白酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/timorasso-pimengte-yiwang-de-baijiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.28/timorasso-pimengte-yiwang-de-baijiu/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从上世纪八十年代的半公顷到Derthona之名：托尔托纳山丘的Timorasso如何从灭绝边缘归来，以及它今天为何引发争论。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/timorasso-vitigno-salvato.jpg?v=008b0f3a" length="224093" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/timorasso-vitigno-salvato.jpg?v=008b0f3a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>蓝布鲁斯科：从来就不是“廉价酒”的廉价酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.27/lanbulusike-congwei-shi-lianjia-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.27/lanbulusike-congwei-shi-lianjia-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Sorbara、Grasparossa、Salamino：蓝布鲁斯科是一个葡萄品种家族，而不只是出口的甜酒。历史、DOC产区、瓶中二次发酵与艾米利亚的餐桌。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lambrusco-non-e-un-vino-da-poco.jpg?v=54c26e49" length="274321" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lambrusco-non-e-un-vino-da-poco.jpg?v=54c26e49" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>被遗忘的葡萄品种：意大利为何重新发现失落的葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/beiyiwang-putao-pinzhong-yidali-chongxin-faxian/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/beiyiwang-putao-pinzhong-yidali-chongxin-faxian/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从Verdiso到Pecorino，从Raboso到Cagnulari：如何拯救一个濒临灭绝的品种，以及本土品种的风潮为何也有风险。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vitigni-dimenticati-che-tornano.jpg?v=88207a6e" length="169886" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vitigni-dimenticati-che-tornano.jpg?v=88207a6e" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item></channel></rss>
